# scripts/notes/ is vendored byte-for-byte from the write-notes-like-deepseek
# skill and must stay byte-identical to it: scripts/verify-vendored.mjs compares
# sha256 digests against the skill's own copies.
#
# Without this, git normalises the CRLF line endings the skill ships to LF on
# checkout, and EVERY fresh clone reports seven files as drifted — a guard that
# is red everywhere is a guard nobody reads. Cost: renames show as whole-file
# rewrites on this one path only.
scripts/notes/** -text
